[bpmn.loop_risk.unbounded_control_cycle] Error: Workflow cycle is missing a complete loop-progress contract
   ,-[ $TEMP/interaction_loop_missing_feedback.bpmn:5:5 ]
 5 |    <bpmn:serviceTask id="prepare_question" implementation="${environment.services.runAgent}">
   |    `------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ cycle needs explicit progress state
   |Help: The loop must feed answer into prepare_question before the next prompt and keep flow_done as the unconditional default exit.
    |Contract: native BPMN loop progress requires in-cycle tasks to consume user feedback and emit the gateway route state through standard IO metadata.

Proposed patch:
```diff
--- $TEMP/interaction_loop_missing_feedback.bpmn
+++ $TEMP/interaction_loop_missing_feedback.bpmn
@@ -5,1 +5,1 @@
